{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChRJL2TUDT7kZqs2WRUUM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the signup button overflow in `styles.css`. I haven't checked it in a browser at 375px.\n\n`.cta` had a fixed `width: 420px` and `white-space: nowrap`. The card is only 343px wide at 375px (the card's 16px side padding takes 32px, and the button's own 24px padding and 2px border add to its width). So the button couldn't shrink or wrap.\n\nChanges to `.cta`:\n- `width: 420px` is now `width: 100%` with `max-width: 420px`, so it fills the card on phones and still caps at 420px on larger screens.\n- Added `box-sizing: border-box`, so the padding and border count inside that width.\n- `white-space: nowrap` is now `normal`, so the long label (\"Create your free account and start your 30-day trial\") wraps onto two lines on narrow screens."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":610,"cache_read_input_tokens":23358,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":610},"output_tokens":277,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8a66f7ef-3184-43e2-9abe-1524f5ec7e93","uuid":"c5d4b49d-b5cd-489f-b7c4-0b47169ccc97","timestamp":"2026-11-26T09:25:52.017Z","request_id":"req_011ChRJL22g3aaVWchKtiMUv"}
